# IntelliROI — Product Context

IntelliROI is an **AI intelligence / governance SaaS**: companies route employee AI usage through a gateway, then roll up **usage → cost → estimated business value → ROI** through the org hierarchy.

## Core chain (never break this)

```
Platform → Company → Department → Team → Employee → Project → Task → AI Request → Usage → Cost → ROI
```

Every AI request must be traceable to **company + department + team + employee + project + task category**.

## Two layers

| Layer | Who | Sees |
|-------|-----|------|
| **Platform** | Super Admin | SaaS health, companies, subscriptions — not customer employee prompts by default |
| **Customer** | CEO → Dept Manager → Team Lead → Employee | Scoped org intelligence + AI Workspace |

## One app, not five

Build **one shell + role/permission/scope-aware modules**. Do not fork separate CEO/Manager/Employee apps.

## Five experiences (same shell)

1. Super Admin — platform
2. CEO / Owner — company executive
3. Department Manager — department only
4. Team Lead — team only
5. Employee — AI Workspace + personal usage/ROI

## Domain split

- **Org entities:** Company, Department, Team, Employee, Project
- **Config entities:** Job Role (hourly cost), AI Providers/Models, AI Policies, ROI benchmarks

## ROI wording

Always say **Estimated ROI** (benchmark-based MVP), never “Actual ROI”.

## Visual identity

Shared chassis (Inter + JetBrains Mono, ink/hairline ops-console). **Unique accent per role** via `data-role-theme` — Super Admin ice cyan, CEO gold, Dept blue, Team teal, Employee mint. Logo always brand mint. See `ROLE_COLOR_IDENTITY.md`.

